# Docs Capability (L1)

When changing project behavior or conventions under `docs/`:

- **Architecture decisions** → new ADR in `docs/architecture/adr/` (numbered sequentially)
- **Repeatable procedures** → add or update `docs/runbooks/`
- Link ADRs from Handoff Decisions section when relevant
- Keep ADRs concise: Context, Decision, Consequences

Do not duplicate long content between ADR and runbook; ADR = why, runbook = how.
Do not copy paper vault Q&A answers into `docs/`; link via `docs/links/paper-vault.md`.
